{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not terminally fail the workflow when ambient MDC capture fails.** An ordinary failure from `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` is routed through `finishFailure`, producing durable `FAILED` before input deserialization or user code starts. A transient logging-adapter issue can therefore permanently terminate customer work. Treat capture failure as retryable invocation infrastructure failure, or fall back to best-effort MDC restoration; update the test that currently expects `FAILED`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-DuAZ","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":299,"observation_digest":"b1e15a5b9a3804352edf6a02e06ed0eee40e582c00621441dbb9ae66e49378ea","observation_id":"aro_v1_whqvuw42hacdklw7niboa3wq53","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:20Z","review_id":"arr_v1_aijmadpi5elrp5dx77z56tmy35","reviewed_base_sha":"bdc1c708ba096fe1d20519e578f972b762242995","reviewed_head_sha":"3fab2d713e2b248ca27f12a6569529ba46388ff6","reviewer":"codex","start_line":298,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_uohhlr4mbui5j7ntczcvpp33td","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T18:19:20Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
